now stock garden tools from local makers.</p>\n        </article>\n        <section aria-labelledby=\"contact-heading\">\n            <h2 id=\"contact-heading\">Contact</h2>\n            <p>Call us or send a message. Prices include <abbr title=\"value-added tax\">VAT</abbr>.</p>\n            <form action=\"/contact\" method=\"post\">\n                <label for=\"contact-email\">E-mail</label>\n                <input id=\"contact-email\" name=\"email\" type=\"email\" autocomplete=\"email\" aria-describedby=\"contact-hint\">\n                <p id=\"contact-hint\">We reply within one working day.</p>\n                <button type=\"submit\">Send</button>\n            </form>\n        </section>\n    </main>\n    <footer>\n        <p>Acme Hardware, Berlin</p>\n    </footer>\n    <!-- Hidden leftover outside every landmark: not rendered, not content. -->\n    <div hidden>Summer sale banner</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
